    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the workers' compensation law, in relation to requiring the state insurance fund to file annual audited financial statements with the office of the state comptroller",
    "basePrintNo": "S5540",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5540-2011",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
